WEBVTT

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:38.670
Pursuing Jillas after he
stole the Sword of Light...

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:40.940
...we ended up inside
Valgaav's main base.

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:44.480
Waiting for us there was a
wounded Almayce.

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:46.250
And then!

00:01:57.530 --> 00:01:59.230
What do you mean?

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.900
Let's get to the point.
The reason I've come before you...

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:10.900
...is because I've been ordered to
bring you to the Monster race's side.

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:15.010
You see, the sad truth is
that the Monster race...

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:17.710
...has a shortage of talented
people like yourself.

00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:19.380
The focus of this battle...

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:22.550
...the summoning of the
Overworld dark lord Darkstar...

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:25.460
...has become a very
important matter to us.

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:29.720
While the higher-ups were
originally in favor of it...

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:33.390
...our current difficulties with
the Gods make it impossible.

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:37.600
Therefore, I'm prepared
to grant a full pardon...

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:40.160
...if you let me sign you
up for the Monster race.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:44.870
Of course, we're prepared to
compensate you for this.

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:46.170
Compensate me?

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:50.080
If you agree to join us...

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:54.240
...then the person
responsible for Gaav's death...

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:57.490
In other words, Lina Inverse...

00:02:57.560 --> 00:03:00.030
...I shall personally
finish off for you.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:05.460
Wh- What did you say?!

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:08.100
Oh, my. It's Filia.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:14.040
Xellos! You'd trade Miss Lina's
life to get Valgaav on your side?!

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:16.710
Oh? Are priestesses of
the Fire Dragon King...

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:18.470
...normally given
to eavesdropping?

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:20.710
That's beside the point!

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:22.840
Were you serious
about what you just said?!

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:24.140
Of course I was!

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:28.380
I'd gladly kill Lina
with my own hands!

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:32.320
Aren't you Miss Lina's friend?!

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:36.020
No. I simply travel
with Miss Lina's party...

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:39.430
...because their objectives
often overlap with my own.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:41.860
Please don't forget.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.930
I'm a MONSTER, remember?

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:47.100
Oh, no!

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:56.380
Almayce! You're not trying to summon
Darkstar to destroy this world?!

00:03:56.680 --> 00:04:01.680
No. Our true objective
is to destroy Darkstar.

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:04.220
What do you mean?

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:07.580
Originally, we were
servants of Volphied...

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:10.650
...in his eternal battle
against Darkstar.

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:13.290
Servants of Volphied?

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:16.930
Meaning you were fighting
on the Gods' side?

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:18.730
I suppose you could say that.

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:26.200
You, uh... You don't really
look like a God, you know.

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:37.520
For a period unimaginably long,
we and Darkstar's forces fought.

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:44.300
<i>The terrible war ended
with our destruction.</i>

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:50.770
<i>Darkstar's true objective was to
destroy us along with that world.</i>

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:54.870
<i>And as he went on, we thought
he would finally succeed...</i>

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:56.640
<i>... in destroying our home.</i>

00:04:56.710 --> 00:05:01.700
<i>However... The energy he absorbed
from Volphied when he defeated him...</i>

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:04.210
<i>... began to go out of control.</i>

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:07.880
<i>He also destroyed the
troops who followed him...</i>

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:11.390
<i>... having become a war-crazed
demon of destruction.</i>

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:15.330
<i>Having forgotten
his original purpose...</i>

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:18.160
<i>... Darkstar embarked on a
<i>war against all living things.</i></i>

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:22.500
<i>All that was left in the end
was a dead, pathetic wasteland.</i>

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:28.800
But what does that have to do
with you coming to this world?

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:33.870
The survivors began a desperate
search for a way to destroy Darkstar.

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:39.320
And that is when we learned of the
five weapons created by Darkstar.

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:42.850
One of which is the
Sword of Light. Gorun Nova.

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:47.050
And we also learned how the
power of those five weapons...

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:49.820
...could break apart
Darkstar's own power.

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:51.290
Break apart his power?

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:56.000
Exactly. Just as Shabranigdo of this
world was broken into seven parts...

00:05:56.070 --> 00:06:00.330
...we would use the five weapons as a
gateway and divide Darkstar's power.

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:02.500
And then destroy
each piece separately.

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:05.310
That was the plan we made.

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:09.540
Hmm... So, in the end
this all means what?

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:18.060
This is no time to worry about you
not understanding something!

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:20.320
We're in trouble!
MAJOR trouble, okay?!

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:21.590
Okay! I get it!

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:24.720
So, any more to your story?

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:29.460
We set out to various worlds in
search of the five weapons.

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:32.460
At last, I came to this one.

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:35.500
The rest you already know.

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:38.670
I came to find the last two
weapons hidden on this world.

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:40.880
And joined forces with Valgaav.

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:46.850
Now that we've recovered
the Sword of Light...

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.750
...it's dangerous to
stay here any longer!

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:50.910
We have to find Lina and the
others and get out of here!

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:51.650
Right!

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:53.890
Don't drag me so hard!

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:58.060
Shut up! If you don't like being
dragged, you can run with us!

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:06.030
Now then... Do you have an
answer for my proposal yet?

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:09.230
Will you join the
Monster race, or else?

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:13.400
Don't do it! Valgaav, joining the
Monster race would be a mistake!

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:17.110
Oh, are you asking him to
join your people, then?

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:19.570
W- Well...

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:22.090
You're just wasting
your time, aren't you?

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:25.180
Considering how
you golden dragons...

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:29.190
...murdered his tribe,
the ancient dragons.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:34.700
The golden dragons feared
their power so much...

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:37.930
...that they gathered a huge
army and wiped them out.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:44.140
Silence! Silence! SI LENCE!!!

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:49.480
You Monsters are no different!

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:51.880
Didn't your race
try to kill Lord Gaav...

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.940
...because they feared his power
once he turned against them?!

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:56.150
Well, that is true...

00:07:56.260 --> 00:07:59.520
Then a Monster like you has no
right to smugly lecture her...

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:02.460
...on the reasons
my people were killed!

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.960
The only one who ever
helped me was Lord Gaav!

00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:11.270
And I will never forgive the
Monster race who killed him!

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:15.200
Then can I assume you've
no intention of joining us?

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:17.640
Take THIS as my answer!

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:23.440
I suppose so.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.510
I knew from the start that
this was a waste of my breath.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.310
But I was ordered to make
the proposal to you.

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:33.380
I have another
order to carry out now.

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:38.920
If you didn't join us, I am to use
any means necessary to kill you.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.360
I'm afraid I'm your enemy now.

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:43.700
YOU WERE MY ENEMY
FROM THE START!

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:50.030
Now, hold on a second!

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:53.040
If your objective was
to destroy Darkstar...

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:56.310
...why didn't you ask the people
of this world for help?

00:08:57.150 --> 00:09:01.450
Because saying it would
guarantee we'd never be helped.

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:05.650
Darkstar has to be
summoned for this to work.

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:10.760
Doing that would certainly
put this world in grave danger.

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:14.820
Do you think anyone of this world
would help us to do that?

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:18.790
No, I'm not saying you
people are wrong.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:20.960
It's common sense not to help.

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:24.840
That was why the only way
to accomplish our task...

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.940
...was to become your enemies.

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:29.780
I guess so...

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:34.980
What we desire is
to protect this world!

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:38.550
For that, we will even
sacrifice the Sword of Light!

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:42.360
At the temple, even
a servant of the Gods...

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:45.060
...like the Supreme Elder
could only think of this world.

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:49.760
No wonder Almayce felt that
he couldn't depend on him.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:53.560
But now it seems Valgaav is
planning to summon Darkstar here...

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:56.940
...before all five of the weapons
have been gathered.

00:09:57.010 --> 00:10:00.170
If he does, we won't be able
to divide Darkstar's power!

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:01.810
You gotta be kidding!

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:04.870
If that guy gets here all nice
and healthy, then this world...

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:06.220
...will end.

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:11.860
Hmm... I don't really follow this,
but we can't allow that, right?

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.420
We have no time to lose.

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:17.220
We've gotta get the Sword
of Light back at once!

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:42.640
You... son of a!

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:47.020
You shouldn't
underestimate me, my friend.

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:50.260
Despite appearances,
I killed thousands of your kind...

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:54.360
...in the War of the Monster's Fall.

00:10:56.440 --> 00:11:01.430
And don't you underestimate
the power I have!!!

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:06.110
I also possess
the power of Lord Gaav!

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:15.580
So, is this really all the
power Gaav gave you?

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:17.140
SI LENCE, DAMN YOU!!!

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:37.500
What was?!

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:40.380
Do you think something's happened
to Miss Lina and the others?

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:41.570
Let's go!

00:11:41.650 --> 00:11:42.380
Right!

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:45.810
Leave me out of it!

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:51.590
Why, you!

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:02.870
It doesn't matter what you
fire if you can't hit me.

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:05.070
Conversely...

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:09.240
...small wounds cause great
damage if you make enough of them.

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:12.710
Valgaav!

00:12:19.390 --> 00:12:21.050
Damn... you!!!

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:27.120
You still don't understand?

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:29.350
No!

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:16.330
I was trying to surprise Valgaav.
Guess it didn't work.

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:18.170
You are the most repulsive!

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:21.740
Now, then, why don't we end this?

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:24.740
That's supposed to be MY line.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:30.080
I don't know what,
but SOMETHI NG'S sure started.

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.980
It sounds like
Valgaav is fighting.

00:13:33.230 --> 00:13:34.660
Then we'd better hurry!

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:37.520
LIGHT, COME FORTH!

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.280
Xellos!

00:13:56.780 --> 00:14:02.310
Looks like... I've really
botched this job...

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:05.520
I warned you not to
underestimate me!

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:08.920
Both of us
hated by our own races...

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:12.830
I, with the power of a
dragon and of Lord Gaav!

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:15.730
Tell me how it feels!

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:18.000
This way!

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:19.500
Miss Lina!

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:22.930
Huh? What the?
What's going on here?

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:24.270
Xellos?!

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:27.010
You were fighting Valgaav?

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:29.040
How'd this happen?

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:31.640
Oh, my... I offered him
you in exchange...

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:35.350
...for him joining
the Monster race.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:39.650
He got mad and thought
I was trying to trick him.

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:42.160
Discussions went on about
how you'd react after that.

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:45.030
Something wrong?

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:48.830
Hey! He's hurt!

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:51.230
What, is that all you're
going to do to him?!

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:55.370
Xellos tried to sell out
your life to Valgaav!

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:59.110
Well, Xellos is a Monster,
so I'd expect him to do that.

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:02.420
We stay together with that
understanding, you know?

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:04.470
Wha? Oh... really...

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:09.810
In exchange, I get to use Xellos as
a convenience item when I need to.

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:12.120
Uh, ri-i-ight.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:13.520
Anyway...

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:16.220
Our friend here seems like he's
gone through a few changes.

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:20.520
Yes. If you intend to fight him,
please be careful.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.370
You're gonna pay for hurting Xellos!

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:25.400
Agh! I forgot!

00:15:26.870 --> 00:15:28.400
- Lina!
- Mr. Gourry!

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:30.540
Zel! Amelia!

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:32.950
Looks like we made it in time.

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:35.240
Leave me out of this!

00:15:35.320 --> 00:15:36.440
Here, Mr. Gourry!

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:40.450
All right!
This is my sword, all right!

00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:42.190
This'll do just fine!

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:43.590
So lose the other one already!

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:58.390
So, everyone's here now...

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:03.240
Almayce, you really have turned
against me, haven't you?

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:08.080
That's not true,
but I can't let you do this.

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:13.820
Don't assume you'll win
because I'm outnumbered.

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:14.680
What?

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:23.890
Filia, get Xellos out of here.

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:26.830
Right.

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:28.930
Don't even bother.

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:33.460
Either way, you're going to die.

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:36.970
I never imagined...
you'd ever help me.

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:39.010
This is no time to
be discussing that!

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:42.150
Incoming!
BURST FLARE!

00:16:50.390 --> 00:16:52.020
- Light, come...
- Gourry, no!

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:53.350
Don't draw the Sword of Light!

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:55.650
Dammit!

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:03.270
VALGAAV!

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:17.020
I'll take that back!

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:24.820
Almayce!

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:28.090
My power... is already...

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:32.200
...beyond anything you can fight!

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:40.940
Damn! There's nothing we
can do against this!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.710
If I could just use this!

00:17:49.550 --> 00:17:51.520
It may be useless,
but it's worth a try!

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:55.220
"Darkness beyond twilight,
crimson beyond blood that flows!"

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:57.020
That won't work, Lina Inverse!

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:59.850
Lina! Light, come forth!

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:07.330
Oh, no!

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:13.000
Let me tell you something:

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:16.840
You only need these two
weapons to open the gateway!

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:18.010
What did he say?!

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:23.070
Now that I have this, waiting until
all five weapons were gathered...

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:24.580
...is no longer necessary.

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:29.650
Now wait here and watch as Darkstar
consumes everything in this world!

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:44.930
We must stop him at any cost!
You must go after him!

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:46.740
What are we supposed to do?!

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:49.140
I know where he's going.

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:52.700
Before the gateway goes out of
control, you must kill him!

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:54.940
Before the gateway
goes out of control?

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:57.280
Gorun Nova and Ragud Mezegis...

00:18:57.350 --> 00:19:01.580
He's going to use the two weapons
as the keys to the gateway.

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:03.980
But he won't be
able to control it!

00:19:04.890 --> 00:19:09.260
The Darkstar energy he'll release
will soon begin to go out of control.

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:12.030
If we're to break up
Darkstar's power...

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:15.430
...we must wait for the other
three weapons to be gathered!

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:16.590
Everyone, move it!

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:17.630
Gotcha!

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:18.640
Mr. Zelgadis!

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:20.870
You're coming, too!

00:19:20.940 --> 00:19:22.430
Oh, I knew it!

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:47.890
What is that power?

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:49.700
Magical devices
from the Overworld?

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:51.700
The Overworld?

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:56.340
Are you joining me?
Gods, Monsters, and Humans...

00:19:56.410 --> 00:19:58.380
The curtain falls on this
unwanted relationship.

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:01.140
Where would the fun be without
an audience to witness it?

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:03.610
Valgaav!!!

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:51.390
Where are we?

00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:59.410
This is where the door will open
upon this world's destruction!

00:20:59.670 --> 00:21:02.670
In other words,
where you all will die!

00:22:23.590 --> 00:22:24.990
Whoa, hold on, Valgaav!

00:22:25.060 --> 00:22:28.080
You're not serious about
summoning Darkstar, are you?!

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:29.360
Huh? You are?

00:22:29.700 --> 00:22:32.600
Next time, " Striding and Swaggering!
Lamentation Without End!"

00:22:32.700 --> 00:22:35.500
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
